msgid ""
"Select your :ref:`XROrigin3D <class_xrorigin3d>` node and click on "
"the :button:`Instantiate Child Scene` button to add a child scene. Select "
"``addons/godot-xr-tools/player/player_body.tscn`` and add this node."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el nodo :ref:`XROrigin3D <class_xrorigin3d>` y haz clic en el "
"botón :button:`Instanciar escena hija` para añadir una escena hija. "
"Selecciona ``addons/godot-xr-tools/player/player_body.tscn`` y añade este "
"nodo."

msgid ""
"We want to enable this on the right hand controller. We do this by adding a "
"subscene to the right hand :ref:`XRController3D <class_xrcontroller3d>` "
"node. Select ``addons/godot-xr-tools/functions/movement_direct.tscn`` as the "
"scene to add."
msgstr ""
"Queremos activar esta función en el controlador de la mano derecha. Para "
"ello, añadimos una subescena al nodo :ref:`XRController3D "
"<class_xrcontroller3d>` de la mano derecha. Selecciona ``addons/godot-xr-"
"tools/functions/movement_direct.tscn`` como escena que se va a añadir."

msgid ""
"Instead, we are going to add the ability for the player to also turn with "
"this joystick. We will add another subscene to our controller node, select "
"``addons/godot-xr-tools/functions/movement_turn.tscn`` for this."
msgstr ""
"En su lugar, vamos a permitir que el jugador también gire con este joystick. "
"Para ello, añadiremos otra subescena a nuestro nodo de controlador. "
"Selecciona ``addons/godot-xr-tools/functions/movement_turn.tscn``."

msgid ""
"Add a new child scene to your left hand :ref:`XRController3D "
"<class_xrcontroller3d>` node by selecting the ``addons/godot-xr-tools/"
"functions/function_teleport.tscn`` scene."
msgstr ""
"Añade una nueva escena hija al nodo :ref:`XRController3D "
"<class_xrcontroller3d>` de la mano izquierda seleccionando la escena "
"``addons/godot-xr-tools/functions/function_teleport.tscn``."
